<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 27pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -27pt; background-color: white"><B>Note:</B>&nbsp;&nbsp;Please
sign exactly as your name or names appear in the Company&rsquo;s stock transfer books. When shares are held jointly, each holder should
sign. When signing as executor, administrator, attorney, trustee or guardian, please give full title as such.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 27pt; background-color: white">If the signer is a corporation, please
sign full corporate name by duly authorized officer, giving full title as such.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 27pt; background-color: white">If the signer is a partnership, please
sign in partnership name by authorized person.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 27pt; background-color: white">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 27pt; background-color: white">Please provide any change of address
